<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to the Team!</title>
    <style>
        /* Global Styles */
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;

            background-size: cover;
            height: 100vh;
            color: #ffffff;
        }



        .email-container {

            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: #333333;

            background-color: #E1B7FF;
        }

        h2 {
            color: purple;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .table-container {
            width: 100%;
            border-spacing: 0;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .table-container td {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .table-container td strong {
            color: #333333;
        }

        .footer-text {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .footer-text p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #6a1b9a;
            /* Deep purple color for the button */
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #8e24aa;
            /* Lighter purple on hover */
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-container">
        <h2>Welcome to Futura Labs, {{firstName}} {{lastName}}! 👋😊</h2>
        <p>We are excited to have you on board. Below are the details of your account:</p>

        <table class="table-container">
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Mobile Number:</strong> {{mobile}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Password:</strong> {{password}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p>Please use the above credentials to log into your account and get started. If you have any
            questions, feel free to reach out to us at any time.</p>

        <p>We look forward to your contributions and wish you a successful journey with us!</p>

        <a href="https://yourportal.com/login" class="btn">Login to Your Account</a>

        <div class="footer-text">
            <p>Best regards,</p>
            <p>The Futura Labs Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>